# uCoz

uCoz is a platform for building and managing websites on your own. It combines a website builder, CMS modules, hosting tools, AI features, an API, and tools for automation and monetization.

uCoz lets you create a site, enable the modules you need, and manage content, users, templates, files, and settings. The platform fits personal sites, blogs, forums, portals, organization websites, catalogs, classifieds, online stores, educational projects, and sites with paid access.

uCoz supports both visual site management and advanced work through HTML, CSS, JavaScript, FTP, uAPI, MCP, and external AI agents.

